sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant SYS as SIHA/SITB System
  participant SMILE as SMILE System (Main API /api)
  participant M as Middlewares
  participant CTRL as SihaController
  participant MOD as SihaModule
  participant REPO as DB Repositories
  participant G as SihaGateway (External)
  participant EXT as SIHA External API

  Note over SMILE: OpenAPIHono routes, Bearer JWT
  Note over SYS,SMILE: Flow: create at SIHA/SITB → SMILE validates → SIHA/SITB confirms

  rect rgba(200, 200, 255, 0.15)
    SYS->>SMILE: POST /auth/login
    SMILE->>CTRL: route authLoginRoute
    CTRL->>MOD: login()
    MOD->>REPO: AuthKeycloakService
    REPO-->>MOD: user info
    MOD-->>CTRL: user info
    CTRL-->>SYS: 200 OK (LoginResponse)
  end

  rect rgba(200,255,200,0.15)
    SYS->>SMILE: POST /v2/order/integration (Bearer)
    SMILE->>M: Request, DB load, Transaction, authorize, log
    M->>CTRL: prepared create request
    CTRL->>MOD: createOrder(req, parsed)
    MOD->>REPO: OrderRepository.create + mappings
    REPO-->>MOD: created order ID
    MOD->>REPO: update audit + create mappings
    MOD->>MOD: getDetail(orderId)
    MOD-->>CTRL: OrderDetails (validated by SMILE)
    CTRL-->>SYS: 200 OK (OrderDetails)
  end

  rect rgba(255,230,200,0.15)
    SYS->>SMILE: PUT /v2/order/:key_ssl/confirm/integration (Bearer)
    SMILE->>M: Request validations
    M->>CTRL: prepared confirm request
    CTRL->>MOD: confirm via OrderStatusConfirmModule.update
    MOD->>G: validateOrder(payload)  
    G->>EXT: POST validate_* endpoint (Basic Auth)
    EXT-->>G: 200/4xx + message
    G-->>MOD: Result (status, error)
    MOD->>REPO: update order status/history
    CTRL-->>SYS: 204 No Content
  end

  rect rgba(255,200,200,0.15)
    SYS->>SMILE: PUT /v2/order/:key_ssl/cancel/integration (Bearer)
    SMILE->>M: Request validations
    CTRL->>MOD: cancel via OrderStatusCancelModule.update
    MOD->>G: cancelOrder(payload)
    G->>EXT: POST cancel_* endpoint (Basic Auth)
    EXT-->>G: 200/4xx
    G-->>MOD: Result
    MOD->>REPO: update cancel status/history
    CTRL-->>SYS: 204 No Content
  end

  rect rgba(230,230,230,0.15)
    SYS->>SMILE: GET /v2/order/:key_ssl/integration (Bearer)
    SMILE->>M: authorize + loadSlaveDB
    CTRL->>MOD: getDetail(orderId)
    MOD->>REPO: fetch order + kfa mappings
    REPO-->>MOD: Order model
    MOD-->>CTRL: OrderDetails
    CTRL-->>SYS: 200 OK (OrderDetails)
  end

  SYS->>SMILE: GET /v2/orders (filters)
  SMILE->>CTRL: getOrdersRoute
  CTRL->>MOD: getOrdersList(query)
  MOD->>REPO: query orders (pagination)
  REPO-->>MOD: results
  MOD-->>CTRL: OrdersList
  CTRL-->>SYS: 200 OK

  SYS->>SMILE: GET /v2/materials | /entities | /manufactures | /budget-sources
  SMILE->>CTRL: respective routes
  CTRL->>MOD: repo calls
  MOD->>REPO: read datasets
  REPO-->>MOD: datasets
  MOD-->>CTRL: responses
  CTRL-->>SYS: 200 OK